  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/1378288598/v3.14.3</id>
    <updated>2026-09-24T10:54:12Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/zai-org/ZCode/releases/tag/v3.14.3"/>
    <title>v3.14.3</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;feat: update v3.14.3&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The concurrency limit of a running workflow can now be adjusted directly, without stopping the task.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Optimized the reuse logic when modifying and restarting workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Improved the real-time status display for large workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Improved the efficiency of workflow script submission and modification, reducing token consumption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fixed an issue where workflows could cause the interface to crash in some cases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fixed an issue where buttons on workflow cards were sometimes pushed out of the interface.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fixed an issue where the workflow tool took up too much context.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
